        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Aristocracy</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 750 BCE – c. 1918 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Power held by</span><span class="info-stat-val">A small hereditary or landed elite, acting through councils, senates, diets and upper houses, often beside a monarch who depended on it</span></div>
